[M31_FutureWarfare X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Future Warfare"
LocFlyOverText="Future Warfare"
LocLongDescription="Whenever the <Ability:ClassName> uses an offensive protocol, reduce the cooldown of all offensive protocols by <Ability:M31_FutureWarfare_CooldownReduction>. Can activate <Ability:M31_FutureWarfare_ActivationsPerTurn> time(s) per turn."
LocHelpText="Whenever the <Ability:ClassName> uses an offensive protocol, reduce the cooldown of all offensive protocols by <Ability:M31_FutureWarfare_CooldownReduction>. Can activate <Ability:M31_FutureWarfare_ActivationsPerTurn> time(s) per turn."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Applies to <Ability:M31_OffensiveProtocols>.<br><Bullet> Reduces the cooldown of the ability that activated the effect."

